<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Linkful shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Linkful shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of steel trader Linkful International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.10 to HK$1.16 on Monday on volume of 341.71 million shares.</p>
<p>In a statement earlier on Tuesday, Linkful said it was not aware of any reason behind the surge in share price and there was no change in the company's operations and principal activities.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
